+/// Applies chart edits while reusing ownership of the original XML buffer.
+///
+/// `data` must describe the same `xml` bytes. Output is byte-identical to
+/// [`apply_chart_edits`]. If the final length fits the original capacity, the
+/// allocation and capacity are preserved, including for mixed structural edits.
+/// Empty edits return the original vector unchanged.
